{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"还能承担什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经试过，行动带来的力气并不能消掉对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动带来的力气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他总怪自己不够坚定，可真正难的是，行动给过他力气，那种生活也给过他安慰，两样他都舍不得放下。\",\n      \"key\": \"两样都舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道这两样很难都护周全，想到要付出的代价，心里还是疼，盼着别失去太多。\",\n      \"key\": \"很难都护周全\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想出两边都顾到的办法，也怕失去安宁，仍带着怕去争取。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着怕去争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后，他重新考虑自己还能承担什么，作为重新行动的起点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来的力量不能消除牵挂、旧愿能给他安慰却不能独自护住珍惜之物的两面经验；具体限制由前面愿望尚未实现、温柔可能受损的经历承接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4保留他不再只怪自己不够坚定、而是两样都真心珍惜的认识；S11-5明确补回两样很难都护周全的判断，不再把它仅仅写成暂时还没找到办法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\", \"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留代价带来的心疼和不愿轻易放弃争取的理由，删去重复S07-2的停下也未必护得住珍惜之物，由跨段箭头承接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他还怕失去安宁、尚无两全办法却仍继续争取的实际推进，删去重复的原则性宣告，让害怕与行动同时成立。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d033f17b-c073-499a-b76f-645444e1b007", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T213229877103Z", "elapsed_seconds": 253.64, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:36:43.524887+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6adb4514298f36717435dae129f308dbf0d93e0a868bf94e44f84f9b1ef357b0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0,